invariant: INV-55
file: handshake_post.c
catches: unit
reason: the run limit refuses the last KeyUpdate of a full run, one fewer
  than CH_KEY_UPDATE_RUN_MAX, the number the build record states. bin/unit
  reads two full runs, each ended by a data record of one byte.

--- old
    if (t->key_update_run >= CH_KEY_UPDATE_RUN_MAX) {
--- new
    if (t->key_update_run >= CH_KEY_UPDATE_RUN_MAX - 1) {
